AUTONOMOUS REVENUE OPERATIONS ENGINE (AROE)

An event-driven, multi-agent revenue operations platform built in n8n. AROE takes an inbound lead from raw form submission through qualification, research, scoring, deal creation, outreach, and meeting scheduling, entirely autonomously, with a human only ever involved to review a Hot lead's calendar invite.

This isn't a single linear automation. It's a modular system of one orchestrator and several purpose-built child workflows, each doing one job well, coordinated through explicit data handoffs and a shared error-handling layer.

